{"5159630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tales of Acilain : Bound by Shadow", "steam_appid": 5159630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5159970], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STRUGGLE FOR CONTROL HAS BEGUN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the first journey, Vale absorbed the Shadow King's spirit and paid the price. Years later, you awaken in a mysterious desert temple. The ancient magic within the ruins has weakened the entity, giving you one last chance to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast Kingdom of Acilain to hunt down the Seven Relics, sealing the dark entity before it takes total control of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the Spirit Hand:</strong> Harness spectral magic to grab, lift, and throw objects. Manipulate the environment to solve dynamic dungeon puzzles and crush foes in combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absorb Boss Powers:</strong> Slay colossal chamber guardians and claim their abilities as your own. Steal elemental powers from defeated bosses to unlock new combat strategies and hidden areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unearth the Seven Relics:</strong> Journey across a changed kingdom to discover ancient artifacts capable of purging the darkness once and for all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delve into Subterranean Ruins:</strong> Conquer treacherous catacombs packed with lethal traps, subterranean beasts, and secret paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the World From Yourself:</strong> Fight against time and the corruption consuming your mind. Can you withstand the shadow long enough to return home to your family, or will you become the very evil you fought to destroy?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_ga